WEBVTT

00:07.902 --> 00:13.662
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:14.162 --> 00:19.752
Subs originally by Froth-Bite
Manually retyped by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.792 --> 00:28.342
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:28.342 --> 00:30.212
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:31.592 --> 00:34.142
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:34.472 --> 00:37.972
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:39.472 --> 00:40.812
That's because...
sore wa...

00:42.812 --> 00:45.562
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:45.692 --> 00:48.902
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:50.862 --> 00:51.862
That's the truth.
henne

00:54.412 --> 01:01.122
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:01.452 --> 01:03.462
...with you.
futaride

01:04.462 --> 01:10.172
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:10.842 --> 01:16.262
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:16.472 --> 01:24.772
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:24.772 --> 01:26.602
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:43.792 --> 01:45.082
Kozue-chan!

01:45.082 --> 01:47.002
Let's go home.

01:47.002 --> 01:48.132
Yeah...

01:48.132 --> 01:49.502
What's wrong?

01:49.962 --> 01:52.302
Look...

01:57.012 --> 01:58.642
Do you want to stop by there?

01:58.642 --> 01:59.722
Sure.

02:03.392 --> 02:09.112
<b>Color of the Sky</b>

02:09.322 --> 02:11.442
Wait, Curry Girl.

02:11.442 --> 02:12.742
Yes?

02:19.162 --> 02:22.502
We have no time to play with you, President.

02:24.212 --> 02:25.672
How sassy.

02:25.672 --> 02:29.502
I'm the one who spent some time with you the other day.

02:30.842 --> 02:33.672
You mean you weren't serious?

02:37.682 --> 02:41.602
Curry Girl, would you like to join our club?

02:42.182 --> 02:43.682
President!

02:43.682 --> 02:47.062
I will seriously get mad if you get Kozue-chan involved.

02:47.852 --> 02:50.772
I'm not asking you, Member Tamami.

02:53.442 --> 02:56.242
You're pretty good.

02:56.242 --> 02:58.372
I'd love to have you.

02:59.572 --> 03:05.872
But I have a job as a landlady, so I can't attend activities after school.

03:05.872 --> 03:07.332
That will be fine.

03:07.332 --> 03:12.302
You don't have to do anything after you fill out your application.

03:12.302 --> 03:15.672
Do I really not have to do anything?

03:15.672 --> 03:17.052
Of course.

03:17.052 --> 03:19.802
Because we are the Occult Lab.

03:19.802 --> 03:23.892
What we need are ghost members.
(Note: By "Ghost Members", she means inactive members.)

03:27.442 --> 03:29.772
Then I'll join.

03:29.772 --> 03:32.152
Why, Kozue-chan!?

03:32.152 --> 03:33.152
Because...

03:33.692 --> 03:37.242
...I should join the same club as you.

03:37.572 --> 03:38.952
Kozue-chan...

03:42.702 --> 03:44.622
Then, it's a deal.

03:45.792 --> 03:47.412
She still can't!

03:47.412 --> 03:51.132
Kozue-chan shouldn't get involved with a wench like you!

03:52.672 --> 03:55.842
A wench?

03:55.842 --> 03:57.092
Tamami-chan...

03:57.092 --> 03:59.132
Don't mind her, and let's go home.

04:00.932 --> 04:02.932
Wait, Member Tamami.

04:05.102 --> 04:07.022
Abuse me more!

04:07.682 --> 04:10.772
I mean, I won't let you go.

04:10.772 --> 04:12.362
We must have an emergency Sabbat.

04:13.022 --> 04:14.022
Tamami-chan!

04:14.022 --> 04:16.692
Kozue-chan, go ahead.

04:16.692 --> 04:17.192
But...

04:17.192 --> 04:18.992
I'll be right behind you!

04:18.992 --> 04:19.862
I'll be waiting.

04:19.862 --> 04:22.032
Yes!

04:22.032 --> 04:24.702
Futabadai Station

04:25.292 --> 04:29.042
I think you'd better go straight home.

04:29.042 --> 04:30.712
We have homework to work on.

04:30.712 --> 04:33.342
Yeah, but...

04:35.842 --> 04:38.922
I need stimulation in order to complete the assignment!

04:38.922 --> 04:39.172
Women
Women
I need stimulation in order to complete the assignment!

04:39.172 --> 04:41.932
I need something that stimulates my senses!
Women
Women

04:41.932 --> 04:42.182
I need something that stimulates my senses!

04:42.182 --> 04:44.102
R-Really?

04:44.102 --> 04:48.772
You wouldn't understand how I feel.

05:02.822 --> 05:04.822
Occult Laboratory

05:09.502 --> 05:10.712
Yes!

05:10.712 --> 05:12.622
This is it!

05:12.622 --> 05:15.132
I think I'm dying!

05:16.752 --> 05:20.012
Simmer like this for another 74 hours,

05:20.012 --> 05:23.392
and we will have the legendary potion.

05:32.852 --> 05:35.522
Member Tamami, where are you going?

05:35.522 --> 05:39.072
Our next task is the creation of the strongest barrier.

05:39.072 --> 05:42.112
You must not leave until it's complete.

05:45.572 --> 05:49.742
Give me a break, you crazy black mass maniac.

05:49.742 --> 05:52.292
Black mass maniac...

05:53.582 --> 05:54.372
Nice!

05:54.962 --> 05:55.962
Get away!

05:55.962 --> 05:57.792
You barrier-crazed masochist!

06:00.922 --> 06:02.012
Yes!

06:02.012 --> 06:04.802
That's very nice, Member Tamami!

06:04.802 --> 06:07.432
I'm about to die!

06:09.602 --> 06:11.932
Damn, she got away.

06:11.932 --> 06:14.272
I wasn't done with her yet.

06:38.632 --> 06:40.672
I hate getting involved with the President.

06:40.672 --> 06:41.672
Watch out!
I hate getting involved with the President.

06:50.222 --> 06:52.222
Wow!

06:54.682 --> 06:56.142
Wow!

06:56.142 --> 06:59.062
I think she's a junior, Chanahata-san.

06:59.062 --> 07:01.272
Would she join our team?

07:05.532 --> 07:07.742
I couldn't help myself.

07:08.952 --> 07:12.702
It's been a while since people talked about me like that.

07:21.632 --> 07:23.922
Seika Junior College Attached Elementary School

07:42.692 --> 07:44.362
That was amazing!

07:48.612 --> 07:52.082
Ever since I was small, I was a dexterous and clever girl.

07:53.742 --> 07:55.872
Science Chanahata Tamami

07:56.122 --> 07:58.162
Chanahata-san, you got a perfect score again?

07:58.162 --> 07:59.752
Wow.

07:59.752 --> 08:05.422
I learned everything extremely quickly.

08:06.302 --> 08:09.382
I was talented that way.

08:09.382 --> 08:11.392
Calligraphy School Shodo Chateau

08:11.702 --> 08:14.782
Brilliant Letters, Chanahata-san.

08:14.782 --> 08:17.332
The form, balance, and momentum.

08:17.332 --> 08:22.002
Everything is wonderful! Marvelous! Tremendous!

08:22.002 --> 08:25.252
Everyone, imitate her great writing,

08:25.252 --> 08:29.132
and write great and fantastic letters.

08:29.632 --> 08:32.092
Chanahata-san, can you show me?

08:32.632 --> 08:33.682
Sure.

08:33.682 --> 08:35.142
Me too! Me too!

08:35.432 --> 08:39.722
It's a talent that everyone envied,

08:39.722 --> 08:43.642
but I couldn't simply enjoy it.

08:52.322 --> 08:55.952
Hey, Chanahata-san, you're different from everyone,

08:55.952 --> 08:58.202
so hold back a little.

08:58.202 --> 08:59.372
I'm sorry.

09:00.412 --> 09:05.632
My talent enabled me to do many things,

09:05.632 --> 09:07.462
but because of how easy they were,

09:07.462 --> 09:11.762
I lacked the feeling of satisfaction after completing tasks,

09:11.762 --> 09:14.382
and I even lacked...

09:14.382 --> 09:19.102
...basic human emotions like joy and sorrow.

09:23.102 --> 09:25.442
Kozue-chan is waiting for me.

09:25.442 --> 09:26.902
I better hurry.

09:30.692 --> 09:32.402
Let's start heading home.

09:32.402 --> 09:33.402
Not yet!

09:33.402 --> 09:37.412
I can't go home until I find a goddess who triggers my switch!

09:37.412 --> 09:39.282
A goddess, huh?

09:39.282 --> 09:41.832
I don't think there is one.

09:41.832 --> 09:42.752
There is!

09:46.332 --> 09:48.582
There must be one!

09:51.422 --> 09:52.762
Shiratori-san.

09:53.632 --> 09:55.092
Kozue-chan.

09:55.092 --> 09:56.432
Are you heading home?

09:56.682 --> 09:57.432
Yeah.

09:58.842 --> 10:01.102
I've been waiting for you!

10:01.102 --> 10:02.602
Let's not just stand around here.

10:02.602 --> 10:04.562
Let's go to a cafe.

10:04.562 --> 10:09.442
We should talk there and deepen our relationship!

10:09.862 --> 10:12.862
I'm sorry, but not today...

10:12.862 --> 10:14.492
No way!

10:17.202 --> 10:19.572
You're my goddess!

10:19.572 --> 10:21.952
Wait!

10:23.452 --> 10:26.002
Should we get going?

10:26.002 --> 10:27.122
Sure.

10:29.502 --> 10:32.212
And when I entered the 4th grade...

10:39.972 --> 10:41.102
Tama-chan?

10:44.812 --> 10:46.272
Or Mike-chan?

10:46.272 --> 10:48.602
Or Ku-chan?

10:49.272 --> 10:50.232
You're not?

10:51.732 --> 10:52.862
Momo-chan?

11:11.922 --> 11:13.592
I'm Aoba Kozue.

11:13.592 --> 11:14.382
Nice to meet you.

11:16.092 --> 11:17.592
I'm Chanahata Tamami.

11:18.512 --> 11:20.762
Hi, Tamami-chan.

11:20.762 --> 11:21.512
Hi.

11:25.222 --> 11:29.192
I had an encounter when I entered the 4th grade.

11:29.772 --> 11:34.112
My first impression was that she was a strange girl.

11:45.832 --> 11:47.372
Or Mike-chan?

11:47.372 --> 11:49.582
Or Ku-chan?

11:50.332 --> 11:51.622
Aoba Kozue.

11:52.172 --> 11:57.302
My first impression was that she was a strange girl.

12:10.712 --> 12:13.712
Meow, how are you?
I'm Nyanta, Tamami-chan.

12:17.942 --> 12:20.282
Meow, how are you?
I'm Nyanta, Tamami-chan.

12:20.282 --> 12:23.782
How are you, Kozue-chan?
Yeah, I'm fine, wuff!

12:30.622 --> 12:32.582
I'm sorry, Tamami-chan.

12:32.582 --> 12:33.962
It's my fault.

12:33.962 --> 12:35.332
No, it's okay.

12:35.332 --> 12:37.292
Don't worry so much.

12:40.512 --> 12:45.182
But come to think of it, this is my first time being punished.

12:45.182 --> 12:46.802
Sheesh, she's such a...

12:47.182 --> 12:48.352
Cherry blossoms...

12:56.772 --> 12:58.022
Aren't they pretty?

13:00.612 --> 13:03.402
She was really an interesting girl.

13:04.202 --> 13:06.372
Cleaning

13:06.872 --> 13:09.542
I love cleaning.

13:09.542 --> 13:10.872
Why?

13:14.872 --> 13:16.292
Why do I?

13:16.292 --> 13:17.922
Um, it's okay.

13:17.922 --> 13:20.112
Let's eat

13:20.672 --> 13:23.762
Yuck, we got umeboshi for lunch today.

13:23.762 --> 13:24.972
Jeez.

13:24.972 --> 13:26.642
I hate umeboshi.

13:26.642 --> 13:27.802
It's too sour.

13:34.182 --> 13:36.352
Why?

13:36.942 --> 13:41.692
Hey, Tamami-chan, there's something I've been wondering.

13:41.692 --> 13:42.822
What is it?

13:42.822 --> 13:44.452
Why do "me" and "nu" look alike in hiragana?

13:44.452 --> 13:44.952
Me
Why do "me" and "nu" look alike in hiragana?

13:44.952 --> 13:46.952
Nu
Me
Why do "me" and "nu" look alike in hiragana?

13:46.952 --> 13:47.742
I don't know...
Me
Nu

13:47.742 --> 13:48.122
I don't know...

13:48.122 --> 13:48.322
Ne
Wa
I don't know...

13:48.322 --> 13:50.202
"Wa" and "Ne" look alike too.
Wa
Ne

13:50.202 --> 13:50.492
Ne
"Wa" and "Ne" look alike too.

13:50.492 --> 13:50.702
"Ro" and "Ru" look alike too.
Ne

13:50.702 --> 13:51.202
"Ro" and "Ru" look alike too.

13:51.202 --> 13:51.992
Ru
Ro
Ne
Wa
"Ro" and "Ru" look alike too.

13:51.992 --> 13:52.412
"Ro" and "Ru" look alike too.

13:52.412 --> 13:52.492
Ru
Ne
Nu
"Ro" and "Ru" look alike too.

13:52.492 --> 13:54.752
There must be some secret in these twists.
Nu
Ne
Ru

13:54.752 --> 13:56.462
I don't think so.
Nu
Ne
Ru

13:57.582 --> 13:59.462
Two months had gone by since we started the 4th grade.

14:00.042 --> 14:04.212
I was spending more and more time with Kozue-chan.

14:04.882 --> 14:10.222
Kozue-chan's conversations were all ordinary and nothing special.

14:10.512 --> 14:12.722
But for some reason, they didn't bore me.

14:12.722 --> 14:15.732
The area of a triangle is calculated by the base times...

14:16.482 --> 14:17.732
Bye bye!

14:18.102 --> 14:19.442
See you tomorrow!

14:47.222 --> 14:52.052
And eventually, I started to look for Kozue-chan.

15:06.492 --> 15:07.532
Tamami-chan!

15:08.532 --> 15:10.412
What were you doing?

15:10.782 --> 15:12.072
Well...

15:12.782 --> 15:14.412
It's a beautiful day.

15:19.622 --> 15:21.462
The breeze feels good too.

15:26.302 --> 15:29.842
Um, your uniform will get stained.

15:36.012 --> 15:37.352
Tamami-chan.

15:37.352 --> 15:38.062
Yes?

15:38.432 --> 15:40.852
You should try this too, Tamami-chan.

15:40.852 --> 15:42.692
It feels great.

16:25.112 --> 16:26.232
Tamami-chan,

16:27.982 --> 16:29.402
doesn't it feel great?

16:30.902 --> 16:31.702
Yes.

16:44.502 --> 16:46.712
Um, I...

16:48.342 --> 16:51.922
I thought I didn't have a heart...

16:51.922 --> 16:54.802
...that could like anyone.

16:56.642 --> 17:00.142
So I couldn't understand myself, and I was lost.

17:00.772 --> 17:02.642
But I think I understand now.

17:03.732 --> 17:08.942
I feel very special talking to you, which doesn't happen when I'm talking with other people.

17:10.652 --> 17:15.452
It's because I like you, I think...

17:20.622 --> 17:21.662
Um...

17:22.372 --> 17:26.002
You might be wondering what this is, so suddenly,

17:26.002 --> 17:28.212
but I don't know what I'm talking about, and...

17:28.212 --> 17:29.672
...um...

17:29.672 --> 17:30.922
Me too.

17:32.012 --> 17:33.672
I like you.

17:33.672 --> 17:34.552
I love you!

17:36.472 --> 17:37.392
Tamami-chan.

17:37.392 --> 17:38.302
Yes!

17:38.762 --> 17:41.432
Let's stay friends forever.

17:41.432 --> 17:42.312
Yes!

17:42.772 --> 17:48.312
I think it will be many, many times more fun being together than being alone.

17:48.612 --> 17:49.522
Yes.

17:56.532 --> 17:58.322
Isn't it pretty?

17:58.322 --> 17:59.622
Yes.

18:02.042 --> 18:07.122
Since that day, Kozue-chan became my most important person.

18:17.632 --> 18:21.722
Kozue-chan and I will be together forever.

18:22.392 --> 18:24.932
From now until forever.

18:24.932 --> 18:28.272
Futabadai Station

18:29.982 --> 18:32.402
I couldn't find her again.

18:32.402 --> 18:34.282
I should head home.

18:40.742 --> 18:42.492
I won't give up!

18:42.492 --> 18:44.452
I will see you again someday!

18:44.452 --> 18:45.912
Reiko-san...

18:46.502 --> 18:48.622
Are you looking for something?

18:49.832 --> 18:51.962
Yes, for you.

18:53.212 --> 18:54.802
Oh, it's you!

18:56.462 --> 18:59.842
Too bad I wasn't Kozue-chan.

19:00.342 --> 19:02.472
I've met her already.

19:02.472 --> 19:04.972
She went home with Shiratori.

19:05.812 --> 19:09.892
With Shiratori-san?

19:10.192 --> 19:13.652
Yes, they walked home, side by side.

19:16.902 --> 19:18.242
Where did she go?

19:58.612 --> 20:02.202
Kozue-chan, we promised.

20:03.322 --> 20:05.372
I've met her already.

20:05.372 --> 20:08.162
She went home with Shiratori.

20:08.952 --> 20:13.172
I guess I can't help it, if she was with Shiratori-san.

20:13.172 --> 20:14.332
Tamami-chan!

20:16.172 --> 20:18.712
I'm sorry I'm late.

20:21.012 --> 20:22.512
It's okay.

20:22.512 --> 20:24.892
I just got here too.

20:29.182 --> 20:30.482
Kozue-chan.

20:33.692 --> 20:35.442
It's nothing.

20:39.282 --> 20:40.442
Kozue-chan.

20:40.442 --> 20:41.612
What is it?

20:41.612 --> 20:45.322
Um... where's Shiratori-san?

20:45.322 --> 20:47.032
He should be in his room.

20:53.462 --> 20:55.422
Please stop!

20:55.712 --> 20:57.592
Bring me more beer!

20:57.592 --> 20:59.382
My table!

21:00.092 --> 21:01.922
Why are you crying, Shiratori?

21:02.972 --> 21:05.932
I thought that you went home with him?

21:06.222 --> 21:09.892
Yeah, but I made a promise with you.

21:16.812 --> 21:18.942
Then, what have you been doing?

21:18.942 --> 21:24.152
I wanted to eat these with you,

21:24.152 --> 21:25.072
so I was picking them up.

21:27.452 --> 21:29.282
Tamami-chan, have one.

21:29.282 --> 21:30.832
Kozue-chan!

21:44.672 --> 21:45.882
Kozue-chan,

21:47.012 --> 21:48.802
I love you!

21:59.402 --> 22:05.912
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

22:05.992 --> 22:11.712
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

22:13.132 --> 22:19.592
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

22:19.842 --> 22:24.892
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

22:26.852 --> 22:33.602
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

22:33.852 --> 22:39.532
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

22:40.532 --> 22:46.372
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

22:46.372 --> 22:48.622
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

22:48.832 --> 22:55.002
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

22:55.502 --> 23:01.342
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
mouichido togireta yume no fantasy

23:01.342 --> 23:05.972
at my own speed.
aruitemiyou boku no speed de

23:22.022 --> 23:22.182
The Next Episode Preview Corner

23:22.182 --> 23:25.692
Young Kozue-chan and I were so cute!
